<title>USA: Watson Pharmaceuticals wins ok for Norco.</title>
<headline>Watson Pharmaceuticals wins ok for Norco.</headline>
<dateline>CORONA, Calif. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Watson Pharmaceuticals Inc said Wednesday its Watson Laboratories Inc unit had received approval from the Food and Drug Administration to sell Norco tablets for relief of moderate and moderately severe pain.</p>
<p>The approved Norco formulation is a combination of 10mg/325 mg, Hydrocodone Bitartrate/Acetaminophen. The estimated market for this class of analgesic was $300 million in 1996, Watson said.</p>
<p>The product is expected to be launched in the first quarter of fiscal 1997.</p>
</text>
